WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.717
In the Throne Room, a servant blew a trumpet.

2
00:00:08.718 --> 00:00:15.320
"The king and queen are now entering!"

3
00:00:15.321 --> 00:00:20.362
Everyone bowed.

4
00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:26.064
"Wow," Tom whispered.

5
00:00:26.065 --> 00:00:32.814
The king and queen sat on their thrones.

6
00:00:32.815 --> 00:00:37.201
The queen was holding a book.

7
00:00:37.202 --> 00:00:39.961
Suddenly she frowned.

8
00:00:39.962 --> 00:00:54.148
"Oh no!" "I lost my royal bookmark."

9
00:00:54.149 --> 00:01:01.570
"Line up, wizards!" Dirk snapped.

10
00:01:01.571 --> 00:01:05.284
He bowed before the king and queen again.

11
00:01:05.285 --> 00:01:09.727
"The wizards will now do their best spells."

12
00:01:09.728 --> 00:01:13.720
"Yikes." Tom gulped.

13
00:01:13.721 --> 00:01:28.328
"I hope I'm ready, Cat," he whispered.

14
00:01:28.329 --> 00:01:32.610
Dirk led a girl to the king and queen.

15
00:01:32.611 --> 00:01:38.480
"This is my daughter, Ann," Dirk said proudly.

16
00:01:38.481 --> 00:01:44.370
Ann bowed and then waved her wand. Poof!

17
00:01:44.371 --> 00:01:48.779
Dozens of beautiful white birds appeared.

18
00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:51.862
The king and queen clapped.

19
00:01:51.863 --> 00:02:19.643
Then all the other wizards did their spells.

20
00:02:19.644 --> 00:02:26.383
At last it was Tom’s turn.

21
00:02:26.384 --> 00:02:30.720
"Your Majesties." Tom bowed.

22
00:02:30.721 --> 00:02:32.584
"I'm pleased to meet—"

23
00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:38.355
"Ah-choo!" The queen suddenly sneezed loudly.

24
00:02:38.356 --> 00:02:42.499
"AH-CHOO!" The queen sneezed again.

25
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.192
The king frowned.

26
00:02:45.193 --> 00:02:47.445
"My dear," he said.

27
00:02:47.446 --> 00:02:50.331
"Are you okay?"

28
00:02:50.332 --> 00:02:52.593
"Please," Tom said.

29
00:02:52.594 --> 00:02:55.090
"Take my handkerchief."

30
00:02:55.091 --> 00:02:57.703
He reached into his pocket.

31
00:02:57.704 --> 00:03:00.446
But Tom did not pull out his handkerchief.

32
00:03:00.447 --> 00:03:02.379
He pulled out . . .

33
00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:07.255
"A cat!" The queen shrieked. "Ah-choo!"

34
00:03:07.256 --> 00:03:11.554
"A cat?" The king leaped to his feet.

35
00:03:11.555 --> 00:03:18.347
"No cats in the palace!"

